Subject: [PATCH] fix(i18n): complete multilingual coverage across 26 languages

1. hreflang: removed 405 duplicate <link rel=alternate> tags
   (15 duplicated language entries on each of 27 language index pages);
   every index page now has a clean 30-tag set (29 langs + x-default).

2. js/sr-geo-lang.js: banner UI messages extended from 6 to 29/29
   languages (added es,it,sv,no,da,fi,pl,pt,el,cs,ro,hu,bg,sk,hr,lt,sl,
   lv,et,ga,mt,ku,ckb) - visitors now see the language-suggestion banner
   in their own language instead of English fallback.

3. Content: translated the 100 remaining English content blocks
   (2,588 occurrences, ~1,632 words source) on all index.html and
   demo.html pages of 26 language directories (bg..tr, incl. Kurmanji ku;
   ckb was already complete; en/ remains the English source).
   Structured blocks preserved: <strong> hero, sr-tier-feature
   label/tooltip spans, gold-accent CoreSync, footer <br> lines, SVG
   icon prefixes.

Verified: 0 untranslated English blocks remain; HTML structural
integrity identical to HEAD (pre-existing quirks untouched);
position-exact replacements (no diff drift).
